hi this is presh talwalkar  in this video i'm going to teach you a  fun way to multiply numbers called the  slide method of multiplication  let's say you want to multiply three  thousand and twelve by one thousand and  twenty-one  let's do this problem with the slide  method of multiplication  the first step is to reverse the digits  of one of the number  so we're going to take the number 3012  and reverse the digits  so we write down a 2  then a 1  a 0 and finally a 3.  the next step is to take the other  number and we're simply going to copy  down the digits  when you actually do this in practice  you're going to write it on another  piece of paper  for this video we'll just put it off to  the left so we put 1021 off to the left  and now comes the fun part where we're  going to slide the number across  so we're going to take 1021  and we're going to slide it so that the  first digit lines up  and now what we're going to do is we're  going to multiply vertically  and add  so right now we only have two numbers  which is two times one  and that's going to give us our first  digit of the answer which is two  we slide it across  and now with the digits that are  vertically lined we multiply two times  two which is four  and one times one which is one  so adding up four and one  gets us the net next digit which is five  we slide one more time  and now we multiply vertically and add  so two times zero is zero  one times two is two  and zero times one is zero  so in this step of the sliding we only  have two  we continue to slide  so we have two times one is two  one times zero is zero  zero times two is also zero and three  times one is three  so we add two  and three  to get five  we continue sliding we have one times  one is one  zero times zero is zero and three times  two is six  so we add one and six to get a seven  sliding once more we have zero times one  is zero and three times zero is also  zero  so that gets us a zero  and now finally we have three times one  is three  we put in some commas  and that's our answer three thousand and  twelve times one thousand and twenty one  is three million  seventy five thousand two hundred and  fifty two  i hope you like this video please  subscribe to my channel i make videos on  math and game theory  you can also catch me on my blog mind  your decisions  on twitter at preshtalwalker or you can  get my ebooks at amazon  and a video i think you'll like and a  book is multiply numbers by drawing  lines so check it out
 

